<p>Well to be fair, you pretty much got the point - the dialogue is meant to seem like a movie villain monologue, because that's how this version seems himself. The master manipulator who has been pulling one over on the world for however long. If you don't like that, fair enough, but at least its getting across what it's meant to be.</p>
